    "body": "This is not true. You're using the standard branch symbol (``)  in the `[git_branch]` module, which may be available in non _Nerd Fonts_, like fonts with _Powerline_ symbols enabled.\r\n\r\nTherefore, please either change the symbol of `[git_branch]` or add the requirement for a _Nerd Font_.",
